# OpenSky Network API Credentials (Optional)
# If left blank or unset, AeroFlight AM automatically runs in anonymous mode with shared rate limits.
# To use your personal account quota, create an API Client at: https://opensky-network.org
# Copy this file to .env.local and populate the values below:

OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
